# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source data is NOT redistributable and is NOT in this repository.
#
# ACLED's terms restrict redistribution outright. UCDP GED, IDMC GIDD and the
# UNHCR exports are large and carry their own citation and licence conditions.
# Everyone running this downloads them directly from the source - see
# docs/getting_the_data.md. That is a licence requirement, not a preference.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/
data/tidy/
data/world/

# Derived outputs are regenerated by the pipeline. Commit them only
# deliberately - some embed source data and inherit its licence.
#
# The shareable build lives on the gh-pages branch, not here. Produce it with
# IDQ_PUBLIC=1 so ACLED counts are absent; see prototype-python/publish_site.py
# for what is published, what is held back, and why.
outputs/*.html
outputs/*.json
outputs/*.parquet

# environment
.Renviron
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.DS_Store

# IOM DTM pulls, fetched with a personal subscription key. IOM's terms require
# the key to stay private; the data itself is also not ours to redistribute.
data/raw/dtm/

# UNHCR's internal Registration Baseline Survey and the overlay derived from it
# (prototype-python/merge_registration_survey.py). Internal data: keep it out
# of the public repository until the task team clears what may be published.
# protection.py applies the overlay automatically when the file is present.
config/protection_survey.json
config/protection_survey_log.csv
*Registration_Baseline_Survey*.xlsx
